      "summary": "A voice-activated AR experience turning Mahou’s pronunciation into a playful introduction to Madrid.",
      "text": [
        "Dilo como Madrid is a voice-activated AR experience that turns the correct pronunciation of Mahou into an interaction across iconic brand murals in Madrid.",
        "Users scan a QR code, point their camera at the mural and pronounce “Mahou.” When the system recognizes the correct pronunciation, the mural comes alive through AR animation and unlocks an invitation to claim a free Mahou at a nearby bar.",
