        {
          "label": "Status",
          "value": "Spec campaign / concept"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "A campaign concept for Beefeater Light turning its 50% lower alcohol proposition into a visual language rooted in London.",
      "text": [
        "Beefeater has always been deeply connected to London — its streets, architecture, culture and attitude. With Beefeater Light offering 50% less alcohol, the challenge was to communicate reduction without making the product feel like a reduced version of the brand.",
        "The campaign turns “half” into the central creative device. London’s most recognizable icons are divided, cropped and reconstructed in halves while remaining instantly identifiable, creating a visual parallel with the product itself.",
        "The idea became a cinematic and graphic campaign system built around a simple message: Half the alcohol. Full London spirit."
      ],
      "media": [
        {
          "type": "video",
          "src": "/projects/beefeater-light/film-1080p.mp4",
